                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun little twin-stick shooter game. This was my first twin stick shooter game, and I enjoyed the experience. The enemies aren't terribly difficult, and you can easily scale that with skulls and boosters. The story is incredibly basic, so if you're looking for an engaging plot or riveting gameplay, you won't find that here. It's 343, so why would you expect a good story?",
